e . Peter Dinklage returned to play the role of Peter , although the character was renamed Frank . The film was released on 16 April 2010 to mixed reviews . Also in 2010 , a Kannada remake of the film ,\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [\"Frank Oz\"], \"prior_explanation\": \"Frank Oz directed the 2010 comedy film 'Death at a Funeral'.\"}"
